# Sites that block automated requests, so lychee cannot check them.
# Patterns are regular expressions matched against the full URL.
# cf. https://lychee.cli.rs/recipes/excluding-links/

# Returns 999 to all non-browser clients
^https://www\.linkedin\.com/
# Returns 403 to all scripted requests (AWS WAF), even for the homepage
^https://datascience\.wisc\.edu/
